	(text_box "This logic gate is used throughout the system to either boost clock signals or gate them.\n\nAs the oscillator itself has only a fairly weak drive strength (15 pF), we're using the AND-Gate U203 to boost the drive strength to and span a clock tree to gain 3 separate clock signals which have drive strength enough to keep a clean signal over the whole board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
